  "description": "*\"Let's get a divorce.\"*\n\nYoon-a, who had soothed her anxiety by dreaming of a normal married life like everyone else, is told by her husband that he wants a divorce—right after returning from their honeymoon. To make matters worse, the endless overtime after returning to work leaves her physically and emotionally drained, until she receives help from Joochan, the owner of a nearby store. She feels like she should repay him somehow, but… why is this man here?\n\n(Source: Lezhin, translated)",
